Verse 1
[Eb]Just as I [Ab]am, with[Eb]out one [Bb]plea
but [Eb]that thy [Ab]blood was [Bb]shed for me,
and [Eb]that thou [Bb]bidst me [Ab]come to [Eb]thee,
O [Ab]Lamb of [Bb]God, I [Ab]come, I [Eb]come.
